{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14717","headline":"宿慧山寺 · 王武陵","name":"宿慧山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋日游古寺，秋山正苍苍。\n泛舟次岩壑，稽首金仙堂。\n下有寒泉流，上有珍禽翔。\n石门吐明月，竹木涵清光。\n中夜河沈沈，但闻松桂香。\n旷然出尘境，忧虑澹已忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}